# Contact form (optional but recommended)
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Copy the form ID (the part after /f/ in the endpoint, e.g. "xyzabcde")
# 3. Copy this file to ".env" and paste the ID below, then restart `npm run dev`.
# Without it, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's email app.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
